    "notes": [
      "Older Makin consoles have MIDI tabs/pistons per division (e.g. MIDI Pedal, MIDI Great): switch them on so every division transmits. If the organ has a MIDI SEQ socket, record from MIDI SEQ instead of MIDI OUT.",
      "Press the general Cancel piston (0) before recording so every stop starts off; it also sends the all-stops-off message."
